* The 68881's branches with a size, fb<cc>.w (gastor68's form of GCC's fj<cc>) and fb<cc>.l:
* gas takes no size suffix on them (its fb<cc> is the word form, fb<cc>l the long one), so they
* were errors ("Unknown operator").
* fixed: 2026-11-01 r68togas: fb<cc>.w and fb<cc>.l
* options: -m2
* expect text: f28e000e f292000a f2c100000006 4e71 4e71 51fc
 psect t,0,0,0,0,0
 fbne.w L1
 fbgt.w L1
 fbeq.l L1
 nop
L1 nop
 ends
